LRC GAP-DEBT PRODUCT AUDIT
==============================================================================
ArchGap = max_gap / threshold.  Debt = unprotected endpoint count.
The layer histogram records the 2-adic quotient where the debt lives.

BOUNDARY BRANCH: GAP=0 BUT DEBT IS A WITNESS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  label                  class          gap/th      debt     product   first layer_hist
  n=14 initial           boundary_only          0       6           0    1/14 1:6
  n=16 initial           boundary_only          0       8           0    1/16 1:8
  n=18 initial           boundary_only          0       6           0    1/18 1:6

